            <title>[IGNITE-624] &apos;Union&apos; and &apos;Union all&apos; do not supported in SqlFieldsQuery</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-624</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&apos;Union&apos; and &apos;Union all&apos; key words do not supported in SqlFieldsQuery on parsing level.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can just try to execute:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;select &apos;foo&apos; as bar union select &apos;foo&apos; as bar&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;select &apos;foo&apos; as bar union all select &apos;foo&apos; as bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
